  [PASS] D1-b  ...but the framework's OWN prediction at z = 2.5 is a BAND, not the single value 0.00, once DESI evolving dark energy is allowed: -0.122 to -0.009 dex.  Quoting '0.00 dex' as THE prediction understates the framework's own spread and would let a genuine confirmation be scored as a refutation   (CPL band at z = 2.5: -0.122 to -0.009 dex (w=-1 gives 0.000))
